# PHASE-10A-CLOSURE-V1 (CRLF hash defect remediation).
# Preserve committed byte identity for hash-bound R20 oracle evidence.
# loadR3() in evaluation/runner/phase-10a14-r20/commit5r1c13-lib.mjs hashes RAW
# working-tree bytes against the sealed digest R3_SHA. That harness is itself
